<title>USA: URS Corp Q4 Oct 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>URS Corp Q4 Oct 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO, Calif. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>URS CORPORATION</p>
<p>			     Year Ended	    Fourth Quarter</p>
<p>			     October 31	   Ended October 31</p>
<p>			1996	   1995	   1996	  1995</p>
<p> Revenue   $305,470,000 $179,769,000 $102,369,000 $50,196,000</p>
<p>Costs and expenses</p>
<p>		293,415,000  173,413,000   97,650,000  47,837,000</p>
<p>Income before taxes</p>
<p>		 12,055,000    6,356,000    4,719,000   2,359,000</p>
<p> Net income   7,355,000    5,056,000    2,949,000   1,869,000</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>			  .80	    .67	    .29	   .23</p>
</text>
